In triangle $OAB$, $\overrightarrow{OA}=\underset{\sim}{x}$ and $\overrightarrow{OB}=\underset{\sim}{y}$. The point $N$ lies on $AB$ with $AN:NB=3:2$. Find (a) $\overrightarrow{AN}$ and (b) $\overrightarrow{ON}$.
